{"1851810": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Holdouts", "steam_appid": 1851810, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h1>Sign-up to Playtest!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wanna play a rad, cooperative, and third-person shooter with unique style, humor, explosive action, and some of the stupidest weapons ever? We did.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That’s why we’re making it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We aim to craft a different reality and something never seen before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you’re up for the fight, Ruckus is looking for eager and dedicated players to get a firsthand look at the game through early playtesting to provide feedback. You, the player, are our hero (literally and figuratively)! Come Smash, Grab, and Grow with us!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sign-up to playtest at ruckus.firstlook.gg!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Smash</i>, <i>grab</i>, and <i>grow</i> in this third-person, session-based shooter—playable solo or cooperatively. Bash through small-town locales and cobble together anything deadly to build the most unhinged weapons you’ve ever seen. Lawn equipment, power tools, kitchen appliances, vintage 8-track toys—even the brass section of your local band—all become deadly weapons in your hands. Fight back, hold out, and rebuild a home in a warped new reality.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Smash</i>, <i>grab</i>, and <i>grow</i> in this third-person, session-based shooter—playable solo or cooperatively. Bash through small-town locales and cobble together anything deadly to build the most unhinged weapons you’ve ever seen. Lawn equipment, power tools, kitchen appliances, vintage 8-track toys—even the brass section of your local band—all become deadly weapons in your hands. Fight back, hold out, and rebuild a home in a warped new reality.</p>", "short_description": "Smash, grab, and grow in this 3rd person, session-based shooter— solo or coop. Bash through small town locales and turn lawn tools, kitchen appliances, 8-track toys or French horns into the most unhinged and deadly weapons ever. Fight back, hold out, and build a home in a warped new reality.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, Italian<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong>, Arabic, Bulgarian, Czech, Danish, Dutch, Finnish, Greek, Hungarian, Indonesian, Japanese, Korean, Norwegian, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Romanian, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Swedish, Thai, Traditional Chinese, Turkish, Ukrainian, Vietnamese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1851810/077e64e76604ade7a0b0fe508314f0070851c919/header.jpg?t=1786548839", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1851810/7296606162f5681f8d1cdee81ba62ced3bc6d817/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786548839", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1851810/7296606162f5681f8d1cdee81ba62ced3bc6d817/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786548839", "website": "https://www.ruckus-games.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-4790K or AMD Ryzen 5 1500X CPU<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 1080 or AMD RX 5600XT GPU<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 30 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit proces